#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:25
msgid "Add a webhook"
msgstr "Ajouter un webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:35
msgid "What does a webhook receive?"
msgstr "Que reçoit le webhook ?"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:36
msgid "Only the addresses below are called. Each message holds:"
msgstr "Seules les adresses ci-dessous sont appelées. Chaque message contient :"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:39
msgid "the event, the name and address of the site, the date and time"
msgstr "l’événement, le nom et l’adresse du site, la date et l’heure ;"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:40
msgid "the report number and the first 300 characters of its description"
msgstr "le numéro du signalement et les 300 premiers caractères de sa description ;"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:41
msgid "the address of the page, the status, the priority and the name of the assignee"
msgstr "l’adresse de la page, le statut, la priorité et le nom du responsable ;"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:42
msgid "the change made (old and new status, or old and new assignee) and a link to the report in the administration"
msgstr "la modification (ancien et nouveau statut, ou ancien et nouveau responsable) et un lien vers le signalement dans l’administration."

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:46
msgid "It never holds:"
msgstr "Il ne contient jamais :"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:49
msgid "the name, e-mail address or IP address of the reporter"
msgstr "le nom, l’adresse e-mail ou l’adresse IP de l’auteur du signalement ;"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:50
msgid "the screenshot"
msgstr "la capture d’écran ;"

#: includes/Admin/Settings_Webhook_Fields.php:51
msgid "the technical data (browser, console errors, network requests) and the internal notes"
msgstr "les données techniques (navigateur, erreurs de la console, requêtes réseau) et les notes internes."

